    "abstract": "The 1960 Progress Committee would first like to pay its own special tribute to the preceding Chairman, the late Lloyd Thompson, who enlarged and inspired the Committee over the past five years. His untimely passing occurred on December 24, 1960, and he will be greatly missed by his many friends on the Progress Committee, even those who knew him only by his friendly letters.",
